  m_Name: 12. FindImages
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subtitleText:
  - Now, you need to get them back to
  - the exhibits from which they originated.
  - Try scanning some of the posters
  - on the walls around the visitor
  - center to see if they match
  - up with any of the models
  - you captured.
  - As a reminder, you can find
  - more information about each model
  - by looking in your inventory.
